WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:06.968
Polly and Jack are stuck with Miss Mouse.

2
00:00:06.969 --> 00:00:10.491
What will they do?

3
00:00:10.492 --> 00:00:18.488
Polly: We want to go

4
00:00:18.489 --> 00:00:36.763
home! Miss Mouse: This is your home

5
00:00:36.764 --> 00:00:41.308
now. Jack: Polly, can you fly up

6
00:00:41.309 --> 00:01:02.681
there? Polly: I'll try . . . No! Do you hear

7
00:01:02.682 --> 00:01:10.241
something? Songbird: Tweet!

8
00:01:10.242 --> 00:01:12.229
Tweet! Jack: A

9
00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:14.672
songbird! Polly: Yes! On the other side of

10
00:01:14.673 --> 00:01:25.087
this wall. Dig,

11
00:01:25.088 --> 00:01:29.174
Jack! Songbird: Are you here to rescue

12
00:01:29.175 --> 00:01:34.126
me? Polly: We hoped you could rescue

13
00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:37.132
us! Songbird: Miss Mouse likes my

14
00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:41.023
singing. She'll never let me leave.

15
00:01:41.024 --> 00:01:42.851
Polly: We're trapped here

16
00:01:42.852 --> 00:01:45.821
too. She said we have to fly high.

17
00:01:45.822 --> 00:01:48.089
Songbird: I can fly high.

18
00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.946
But there's no way out. Jack:

19
00:01:50.947 --> 00:01:52.584
Yes, there is. Polly:

20
00:01:52.585 --> 00:02:05.377
Follow us! Songbird:

21
00:02:05.378 --> 00:02:13.250
Jump on my back.

22
00:02:13.251 --> 00:02:18.744
Miss Mouse: Stop! You can't leave me.

23
00:02:18.745 --> 00:02:35.560
Polly: Good-bye!

24
00:02:35.561 --> 00:02:54.586
Jack: Now I like flying!

25
00:02:54.587 --> 00:02:59.761
Polly: We're back at the old barn.

26
00:02:59.762 --> 00:03:06.761
Jack: Look! A giant pile of leaves!

27
00:03:06.762 --> 00:03:10.560
Polly: Whoa! Can we jump in it,

28
00:03:10.561 --> 00:03:22.004
Omar? Omar:

29
00:03:22.005 --> 00:03:24.355
Sure! Polly: You were right,

30
00:03:24.356 --> 00:03:33.922
Omar. Sometimes it does take work to find fun!

